AVG(UserID) over a hundred million bigints, where the pinned DuckDB sums the column short by a multiple of 2^64 and rudb does not. Its own hugeint and decimal paths, the same column summed out of a table, its own per counter group sums, and adding the column up outside a database all give rudb's answer, and it reduces to two statements over a 1.3 MB one column parquet file. Written up as 14.10.1 in tamnd/rudb `spec/14-testing.md`, which is the list of places where DuckDB is wrong and we are not. tamnd/rudb-compat#12